<title>JAPAN: Shares in Takefuji Corp rise in afternoon trade.</title>
<headline>Shares in Takefuji Corp rise in afternoon trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in consumer finance company Takefuji Corp rose in Wednesday afternoon trade as investors believed that their price had fallen enough and that they were now a good buy, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0450 GMT, the shares were at 8,340 yen after closing at 7,960 yen on Tuesday. Volume was 95,200 shares.</p>
